uld say: I agree with Agent 3, and I think we have enough evidence to recommend B, unless anyone has further concerns. Provide reasoning: B's reliability, stress handling, technical competence outweigh his memory and interpersonal issues, which can be mitigated. So we keep vote B.\n\nThus public message: I agree with Agent 3, maintain B, summarizing reasons. Provide explicit facts: very conscientious, handles stress well, good weather assessment, excellent computer skills, weak memory for numbers, nasty remarks. Explain mitigation. Then metadata vote B.\n\nProceed."}
